{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>You looked</b> — until now you turned to much and brought it into your houses." "<b>and I blew on it</b> — on that little, and there is no blessing in it. And now, know — \"because of what\": and the meaning is, why was it so? Because of My house that is ruined." "<b>and you run</b> — each one of you goes, and no one sets his heart on the ruin of My house to rebuild it."], :book :haggai, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Haggai" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/hagai"] ["Ibn Ezra on Haggai -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/hagai"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:49:21.505070161Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}